missions.py` since I edited the docs; they pass too (209 passed, 3 xpassed).\n\nChanges, all in the worktree:\n- **`datasette/default_actions.py`**: added `create-view` (`cv`, on the database) after `create-table`, and `drop-view` (`dv`, on the table resource) after `drop-table`.\n- **`datasette/write_sql.py`**: `create` of a `view` requires `create-view` on the database. `drop` of a `view` requires `drop-view` on the view. A create with no database is unsupported, as with tables.\n- **`datasette/utils/sql_analysis.py`**: renamed `dropped_tables` to `dropped_tables_and_views` and added drops whose target is a view. The spurious `delete` SQLite reports for a dropped view is therefore not turned into a `delete-row` requirement.\n- **`docs/authentication.rst`**: added both actions to the `--root` list and added `create-view` and `drop-view` sections in the same format as their table counterparts.\n\n`SPEC.md` is still untracked, and I didn't commit anything.", "ttft_ms": 1847, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 39214, "uuid": "028507b5-37f0-4575-bdd7-1172462db470", "ttft_stream_ms": 1578, "time_to_request_ms": 700, "first_content_frame_ms": 1579, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
